# ST16 (generalization + demo-dodge): ST15 recipe (OPPCH 0.50 + ENT 0.016 +
# GAL_WEIGHT 3.0 + MEGA_WEIGHT 2.0 via indococo-train-mega2 + ST3..ST12 frozen
# finals + HUNT) with two changes:
# (1) add ST13_final @ w1.0 — ST13 failed FR4 71.2 / Gal 23.6 with worse gen
#     panel; expose the learner to that Gal-weak/FR4-weak style as an opponent.
# (2) raise HUNT_final weight 1.0 -> 2.0 — stronger demo-hunter league pressure
#     so the policy learns to dodge demos (user demo-dodge goal; hunter frozen).
# flip_reset 70. From ST15 best. Hypothesis: ST13_final + heavier HUNT improves
# demo-dodge and Gal/FR4 robustness without regressing pool/bp5.
GAMMA=0.998; TPI=300_000; MB=100_000; LR=5e-5; ENT=0.016; OPPCH=0.50; HOLDREL=600000000; DECAY=400_000_000; MINLR=0.4
